"2756764988022108", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_2756764991355441_2269311976582249190_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kUbuq_fm9nIQ7kNvwHrYF-Q&_nc_oc=AdrHMNfk1Oxn5ZXesZi4pE0PRaSY6K5G5tOD87VDZDZbMoVNGEMBzXk-GoG8aMHTGJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR7YjZaxPPW6cZ7wL2IkUqZF_LV1THkA7UILUtbWRIC_Q&oe=6B0DC6C2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2.png", "id": "4492670527670916", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307433_4492670531004249_3892191243148672188_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nf-2CF-KHrwQ7kNvwHcKdNz&_nc_oc=Adp-XHKvOMXECae3TsyZX-AZLF3pzLq0pAUbEz026yCv9jYQOBKgpC__7DHWrX1tbdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR8YJFLLQD44V5vByvSdpJcB04DO1wvE7UIkKchtACegg&oe=6B0DD205"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 3.png", "id": "2030520227679685", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820887_2030520231013018_5579373603812150964_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fUyGd4_sM78Q7kNvwEJVkn3&_nc_oc=AdpeQDEiJnuezr_tPReYdvHjLp_COoieGwmFB6vz-igPiqARXXV2p-DAvcmQZsoCZhQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQYO8pXQ4Fo5VVlNGxtmNPIOTBrKSYw2LPUm40piJ2AFQ&oe=6B0DB3F0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hero Cover - Landscape.png", "id": "4582158552045108", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_4582158555378441_1009529458867220250_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uVC7rzf_ZXMQ7kNvwF1VS9r&_nc_oc=Adqu1eQwuUgWPhZxLhzkkoOlw7eVZUZim7jTsHHd8ZiDQ3jG7Y4388sz4I5CGSDmsnE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRMB5fTdw2Q3H0goTWeBk9srorgQY9wnVZqY8oWNXC01g&oe=6B0DBA7F"}, "display_name": "Sign'n'Sync", "keywords": ["handtracking", "mixedreality", "rhythm", "music", "controllerfree"], "long_description": "Experience the next evolution of **Quest Hand Tracking**. Sign\u2019n\u2019Sync is a high-energy rhythm experience where your hands are the controller. Forget the buttons\u2014use 4 intuitive hand signs to interact with a digital world that glitches, pulses, and dissolves to the beat.\n\n### **CURRENT FEATURES**\n\n*   **Pure Hand Tracking:** Built from the ground up for a controller-free experience.\n    \n*   **Glitch-Dissolve Aesthetic:** Watch the environment react to your performance with unique real-time shaders.\n    \n*   **Two High-Energy Tracks:** Glitch-Pop Energy & Afro-Electronic Groove.\n        \n*   **Studio Mode:** Perfect for seated or standing play in any environment.\n    \n\n### **HOW TO PLAY**\n\nAs the rhythmic gates approach, match the 4 specific hand signs to the beat. Precision is key\u2014the better your timing, higher the score.\n\n### **ROADMAP**\n\nSign\u2019n\u2019Sync is a living project. We are starting with our core \"Studio Mode\" to ensure the Hand Tracking feels perfect. Coming soon in future updates:\n\n*   **\"Sync me to da Club\":** Transform your actual room into a reactive venue using Spatial Data.\n    \n*   **Expanded Setlist:** More tracks ranging from Lo-Fi to Hardcore Electronic.\n    \n*   **Complex Signs:** New gestures to master as the BPM rises.\n    \n\n**Sync up. Sign on. Start the beat.**", "short_description": "Sync your hands. Master the rhythm. Welcome to Sign\u2019n\u2019Sync. Experience the next level of Quest hand-tracking with a unique glitch-dissolve aesthetic. \n\nUse 4 intuitive signs to interact with a digital landscape that pulses to the beat of high-energy electronic tracks. Launching with two energetic launch tracks (128 & 140 BPM). \n\nController-free, immersive, and built for the flow. More tracks and 'Club Mode' coming soon!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/signsync-privacypolicy/privacy-policy", "developer_ter